        "id": "MilioQ",
        "name": "Ultra Mega Fire Kick",
        "description": "Kick a ball that knocks back an enemy. The ball launches upward on hit and falls toward the enemy, damaging and slowing enemies in the area upon impact.",
        "tooltip": "Milio kicks a fireball, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span> the first enemy hit. If it hits, the ball bounces past them and explodes, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/140/200/260/320 + (120% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to surrounding enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by (40/45/50/55/60% + (0.05% Ability Power)) for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Hitting at least one enemy champion with <span>Ultra Mega Fire Kick</span> refunds 50% of it's Mana cost.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Minions and monsters are knocked further and create a larger explosion.</span>",
